      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/kitab-al-ghayba-numani:2:10:58",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/22/2/10/58",
      "text": [
        ": سمعت أبا جعفر يقول: إنّ للقائم غيبة قبل أن يقوم. قلت: ولِمَ؟ قال: يخاف - وأومأ بيده إلى بطنه - يعنى القتلَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.abdullah-al-shahin": [
          "(19) Ali bin Ahmad narrated from Obaydillah bin Musa al-Alawi from Ahmad bin al-Hasan from his father from ibn Abu Bukayr from Zurara that Abdul Melik bin A’yun had said: I heard Abu Ja’far al-Baqir (as) saying: “Al-Qa’im (as) disappears before his rising.” I asked: “Why?” He said: “He fears” and he pointed with his hand at his abdomen. He meant “killing”."
        ]
      }
    },
